{"format":1,"id":"tiefe_ruhe","kurz":"tr","sprache":"de","richtung":"ltr","titel":"Tiefe Ruhe im Liegen","untertitel":"Geführte Ruhe zwischen Wachsein und Schlaf: Körper-Rundgang, Atem zählen, Gegensätze, ruhige Bilder.","haltung":["liegen"],"augen":"zu_oder_offen","ende":"glocke","schlaf_modus":false,"laengen":{"kurz":{"ziel_s":600},"normal":{"ziel_s":1200},"lang":{"ziel_s":1800}},"kb":1701,"abschnitte":[{"id":"ankommen","segmente":[{"id":"s001","art":"sprache","datei":"tr/1.83c15f5c.mp3","ms":6773,"text":"Leg dich auf den Rücken. Ein Kissen unter dem Kopf und unter den Knien kann helfen.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2.5,"normal":4,"lang":6.5}},{"id":"s002","art":"sprache","datei":"tr/2.de13c64b.mp3","ms":3150,"text":"Deck dich zu, falls dir kühl werden könnte.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2.5,"normal":4,"lang":6.5}},{"id":"s003","art":"sprache","datei":"tr/3.f484451e.mp3","ms":7594,"text":"Die Arme liegen neben dem Körper. Die Handflächen zeigen nach oben, wenn das angenehm ist.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2.5,"normal":4,"lang":6.5}},{"id":"s004","art":"sprache","datei":"tr/4.2da4aed8.mp3","ms":5974,"text":"Schließ die Augen, wenn du magst. Du kannst jederzeit aufhören.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s005","art":"sprache","datei":"tr/5.4b0ca8b2.mp3","ms":8349,"text":"Bei dieser Übung bleibst du wach und hörst der Stimme zu. Wenn du doch einschläfst, ist das auch in Ordnung.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2.5,"normal":4,"lang":6.5}},{"id":"s006","art":"sprache","datei":"tr/6.3f33bdea.mp3","ms":3549,"text":"Nimm wahr, wie dein Körper liegt und schwer wird.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3.5,"normal":6,"lang":9.5}},{"id":"s007","art":"sprache","datei":"tr/7.12da2318.mp3","ms":4837,"text":"Hör auf die Geräusche um dich herum. Nah und fern.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":5,"normal":8,"lang":13}},{"id":"st01","art":"stille","in":["normal","lang"],"dauer_s":{"normal":72.6,"lang":78.3}}]},{"id":"vorsatz","segmente":[{"id":"s008","art":"sprache","datei":"tr/8.d24b7412.mp3","ms":7661,"text":"Wähle jetzt einen kurzen, freundlichen Satz für dich. Zum Beispiel: Ich gönne mir Ruhe.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s009","art":"sprache","datei":"tr/9.d84387db.mp3","ms":2700,"text":"Oder: Ich darf jetzt loslassen.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s010","art":"sprache","datei":"tr/10.17afc3bf.mp3","ms":2786,"text":"Sag deinen Satz innerlich dreimal.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":10,"normal":10,"lang":10},"pause_fest":true}]},{"id":"rundgang","segmente":[{"id":"s011","art":"sprache","datei":"tr/11.3c5d246c.mp3","ms":7978,"text":"Jetzt wandert die Aufmerksamkeit rasch durch den Körper. Denk einfach an die Stelle, die ich nenne.","in":["kurz","normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"kurz":2,"normal":3,"lang":5}},{"id":"s012","art":"sprache","datei":"tr/12.1a0dc9d5.mp3","ms":7972,"text":"Rechte Hand, rechter Arm, rechtes Bein. Linke Hand, linker Arm, linkes Bein.","in":["kurz"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3},"pause_fest":true},{"id":"s013","art":"sprache","datei":"tr/13.c1d11787.mp3","ms":4720,"text":"Rücken, Bauch, Brust, Gesicht, der ganze Kopf.","in":["kurz"],"pause_s":{"kurz":3},"pause_fest":true},{"id":"s014","art":"sprache","datei":"tr/14.5bfb5da6.mp3","ms":7820,"text":"Rechte Hand. Daumen, Zeigefinger, Mittelfinger, Ringfinger, kleiner Finger.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":2,"lang":2},"pause_fest":true},{"id":"s015","art":"sprache","datei":"tr/15.df57168d.mp3","ms":7636,"text":"Handfläche, Handrücken, Handgelenk, Unterarm, Ellenbogen, Oberarm, Schulter.","in":["normal","lang"],"pause_s":{"normal":2,"lang":2},"pause_fest":true},{"id":"s016","art":"sprache","datei":"tr/16.ac51efdf.mp3","ms":9072,"text":"Rechte Seite des Körpers. Hüfte, Oberschenkel, Knie, Unterschenkel, Fuß, Z